---
name: Video artifact registration
description: Safely registering a prebuilt video composition as a managed Replit video artifact.
---

When importing a previously generated video composition, stage its scenes and media, create the managed artifact scaffold, then restore only the presentation code and assets. Keep the scaffold's artifact configuration and recording lifecycle hook intact.

**Why:** Video templates evolve, and an older playback hook may appear to work visually while failing the managed export lifecycle validation.

**How to apply:** Treat the manifest and video hook as scaffold-owned. Adapt the imported composition to the current hook API, then validate recording before restarting the workflow.